#: ../../source/recipes/qwen3_8_flash_next.rst:4
msgid "Qwen3.8-Flash-Next"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/recipes/qwen3_8_flash_next.rst:6
msgid ""
"A hybrid architecture interleaving **Gated-DeltaNet (GDN) linear-"
"attention** layers with **Qwen Sparse Attention (QSA)** full-attention "
"layers (architecture ``Qwen4ExpForConditionalGeneration``, one full-"
"attention layer every four). QSA picks its history from compressed keys, "
"so while a compression group is still open its raw keys sit in a small "
"per-request scratch ring that LMCache skips; see "
":doc:`../mp/hybrid_models` for the general handling of Mamba / linear-"
"attention models."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/recipes/qwen3_8_flash_next.rst:16
msgid ""
"Despite the name, this model does **not** share the "
"``Qwen3_5ForConditionalGeneration`` architecture used by the "
":doc:`Qwen3.5 / Qwen3.6 / Qwen3.8 series <qwen3_5>`; it has its own "
"architecture and its own unified block size."
msgstr ""

